@startuml F8.1-D01-busca-global
title F8.1-D01 — Busca global (debounce + fan-out)
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Usuario" as User
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "SearchController" as Ctrl
participant "SearchUseCase" as UC
database "Postgres" as Postgres

User -> WebApp: digita "joão" (Ctrl+K)
note right of WebApp
  debounce 200 ms
end note
WebApp -> Jwt: GET /search?q=joão
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> UC: execute(...)
UC -> Postgres: 4 queries paralelas\n(pg_trgm + FGAC)
Postgres --> UC: hits
UC --> WebApp: 200 agrupado
WebApp --> User: seções por tipo

@enduml
